<title>SINGAPORE: Alexandra Investments to buy London office block.</title>
<headline>Alexandra Investments to buy London office block.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alexandra Holdings Ltd said on Friday its newly-incorporated Channel Islands subsidiary, Alexandra Overseas Investment Co Ltd, plans to purchase a London office block for 8.15 million sterling.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement it intended to hold the 3,898.6 sq m freehold property, known as York House at Pentonville Road, for long term investment. It did not name the seller of the office block.</p>
<p>It said the purchase would be entirely funded by bank financing and was not expected to affect the earnings per share or net tangible asset value per share of the company.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
